<title>LATVIA: Latvian T-bill rates fall at auction.</title>
<headline>Latvian T-bill rates fall at auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>All yields fell again at an auction of Latvian Treasury bills on Thursday and all issues were sold out, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats. There was no auction of one-year paper.</p>
<p> MATURITY   AVG YLD (pct)    AVG LAST WEEK  ISSUE  BID  SOLD</p>
<p> One month    9.34		 9.557	   1.25  2.82  1.25</p>
<p> Three month  9.82		 10.01	   1.5   4.04  1.5</p>
<p> Six month    10.26		10.41	   2.0   8.07  2.0</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +371 721 5240</p>
